%% Blockchain Transaction Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> SUBMITTED: RPC accepts transaction
CREATED --> FAILED: signing/RPC submission error
SUBMITTED --> CONFIRMED: receipt success + required confirmations
SUBMITTED --> FAILED: receipt revert / timeout policy
FAILED --> RETRYABLE: classified transient failure
RETRYABLE --> SUBMITTED: authorized retry, idempotency key
CONFIRMED --> [*]
